  "raw": {
    "pillar": "Interesting Facts",
    "headline": "What’s hidden beneath the Amazon’s trees? A civilization 10x bigger than we thought!",
    "challenge": "The Amazon has long been thought of as a vast, untouched wilderness. But what if it was once home to millions?",
    "solution": "Scientists just uncovered hundreds of ancient earthworks, called geoglyphs, revealing a massive civilization that thrived there. And they think there are thousands more waiting to be found!",
    "resultHeading": "Between 24,000 and 30,000 geoglyphs estimated",
    "resultLine": "This ancient civilization may have supported 1.25–3 million people — read more at the link in bio!",
    "whyMatters": "This discovery completely changes what we know about the Amazon’s history. It shows that complex societies thrived there long before European contact, challenging our assumptions about the region’s past.",
    "engagementQuestion": "What other ancient civilizations might we still be missing?",
    "captionLead": "Scientists just uncovered hundreds of ancient earthworks in the Amazon, revealing a civilization 10x bigger than we thought! Swipe to learn more about this incredible discovery.",
    "storyHashtag": "AmazonDiscovery",
    "sources": [
