  "reel": {
    "script": "The Amazon isn't just a wild jungle. Scientists found hundreds of ancient earthworks. They're called geoglyphs. They show a huge civilization once lived there. Thousands more might still be hidden. They estimate 24,000 to 30,000 geoglyphs. This civilization could've supported millions. It changes everything we thought about the Amazon. What else might we be missing?",
